# Northstar Notes

A compact workspace for turning messy research into readable project notes.

Start trial

## What It Does

Capture sources, extract clean text, organize links, and export notes for review.

## Why Teams Use It

Teams use it when they need a small, repeatable reading workflow instead of a heavy research suite.
